  "Git Bash is required to add marketplaces. Install Git for Windows, then restart the app.": "添加应用市场需要 Git Bash。请安装 Git for Windows，然后重启应用。",
  "Git URL": "Git URL",
  "Git for Windows is required to run local sessions. If it's already installed, set the {envVar} environment variable to the full path of bash.exe and restart the app — or switch to a remote environment.": "运行本地会话需要 Git for Windows。如果已安装，请将环境变量 {envVar} 设为 bash.exe 的完整路径并重启应用，或切换到远程环境。",
  "Git for Windows is required to run local sessions. If it’s already installed, set the {envVar} environment variable to the full path of bash.exe and restart the app — or switch to a remote environment.": "运行本地会话需要 Git for Windows。如果已安装，请将 {envVar} 环境变量设置为 bash.exe 的完整路径并重启应用——或切换到远程环境。",
  "Git is installed but failed to start, usually because of a configuration file it can’t read. The error below explains what to do next.": "Git 已安装但启动失败，通常是因为它无法读取某个配置文件。下方的错误信息说明了接下来该怎么做。",
  "Git is installed but isn’t working.": "Git 已安装但无法正常工作。",
  "Git is installed, but it failed to start. This usually means it can’t read a configuration file. Check your Git configuration, then try again.": "Git 已安装，但启动失败。这通常意味着它无法读取配置文件。请检查您的 Git 配置，然后重试。",
  "Git is installed, but it failed to start. This usually means it can’t read its configuration file. If macOS is blocking access, grant Claude Full Disk Access in System Settings → Privacy & Security; otherwise check your Git configuration, then try again.": "Git 已安装，但启动失败。这通常意味着它无法读取配置文件。如果 macOS 阻止了访问，请在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性”中授予 Claude 完整磁盘访问权限；否则请检查 Git 配置后重试。",
  "Git is installed, but it failed to start. This usually means it can’t read its configuration file. If the error below says “Operation not permitted”, grant Claude Full Disk Access in System Settings → Privacy & Security, then try again.": "Git 已安装，但启动失败。这通常意味着它无法读取配置文件。如果下方的错误信息显示“Operation not permitted”（操作不允许），请在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性”中授予 Claude 完整磁盘访问权限，然后再试。",
  "Git is installed, but your system blocked Claude from running it. This is usually an endpoint security or application control policy. Ask your IT team to allow Claude to run Git, or switch to a remote environment.": "Git 已安装，但您的系统阻止了 Claude 运行它。这通常是终端安全或应用程序控制策略导致的。请让您的 IT 团队允许 Claude 运行 Git，或切换到远程环境。",
