  "Give Claude, get more Claude": "赠送 Claude，获得更多 Claude",
  "Give Feedback": "提供反馈",
  "Give a friend a free week of Pro": "送给朋友一周免费 Pro",
  "Give feedback": "提供反馈",
  "Give feedback about Cowork": "提供关于 Cowork 的反馈",
  "Give me a TLDR on the new docs I’ve been given access to": "简要总结一下我刚获得访问权限的新文档",
  "Give me a consulting deck structure — executive summary through recommendations — with a note on what to put on each slide.": "给我一个咨询演示文稿结构，从执行摘要到建议，并注明每页该放什么内容。",
  "Give me a framework for prioritizing backlog items by impact and effort, and show me how to spot the easy wins. I'll paste my items next.": "给我一个按影响和投入对待办事项排序的框架，并告诉我如何识别容易实现的快速收益。接下来我会粘贴我的条目。",
  "Give me a framework for prioritizing backlog items by impact and effort, and show me how to spot the easy wins. I’ll paste my items next.": "给我一个按影响和工作量对待办事项进行优先级排序的框架，并教我如何发现那些容易取得的成果。我接下来会粘贴我的事项。",
  "Give me a full 360 on an account — deal history, recent calls and emails, open issues, news, and a color-coded health score. Pull the data from my connected tools. If you're missing a source, ask before building.": "给我一份关于某个客户的全方位 360 视图——交易历史、近期通话和邮件、未解决问题、新闻，以及颜色编码的健康评分。从我已连接的工具中获取数据。如果缺少某个数据源，请在构建前询问。",
  "Give me a leadership-ready explanation framework for a budget-to-actual variance.": "给我一个适合向管理层解释预算与实际差异的说明框架。",
  "Give me a quick-hit explanation of one tricky finance concept — like DCF, accrual accounting, or working capital — with a concrete example.": "快速讲解一个棘手的金融概念，例如 DCF、权责发生制会计或营运资本，并给出一个具体示例。",
  "Give me a reusable grant-application paragraph template for a research proposal — I'll swap in my project details.": "给我一个可复用的研究资助申请段落模板，我会替换成自己的项目细节。",
  "Give me a reusable grant-application paragraph template for a research proposal — I’ll swap in my project details.": "给我一个可用于研究提案资助申请的可复用段落模板——我会替换成我的项目详情。",
  "Give me a step-by-step framework for planning a module refactor: how to sequence changes safely and what to test at each stage.": "给我一个逐步框架，用于规划模块重构：如何安全安排变更顺序，以及每个阶段要测试什么。",
  "Give me a work persona based on my favorite books": "根据我最喜欢的书给我设定一个工作人设",
  "Give me feedback on a draft. Be direct about what's not working, what's unclear, and what to cut — I can handle it.": "给我一份草稿的反馈。直接告诉我什么不奏效、什么不清楚、什么应该删除——我能接受。",
  "Give me five rapid-fire design judgment calls — real tradeoffs with no clean answer, one at a time. I’ll pick and defend each; you push back, keep score, and then profile my instincts: where they’re solid, where I’m guessing, and what that says about the engineer I am right now.": "给我五个快速的设计判断题——都是没有标准答案的真实权衡，一次一个。我会逐一选择并辩护；你则反驳、计分，然后勾勒出我的直觉画像：哪里扎实、哪里在猜，以及这说明了现在的我是怎样的工程师。",
  "Give me my morning brief right now: overnight email worth reading, today’s meetings, and the one thing that needs me first. If it’s useful, set it up to run every weekday morning.": "现在就给我晨间简报：值得一看的隔夜邮件、今天的会议，以及最先需要我处理的一件事。如果有用，就把它设置成每个工作日早上运行。",
  "Give me my morning inbox brief right now: what came in overnight, what needs me first, what can wait. If it’s useful, set it up to run automatically every weekday morning so I start ahead.": "现在给我一份早间收件箱简报：一夜之间收到了什么、什么最先需要我、什么可以等等。如果有用，把它设置成每个工作日早上自动运行，让我抢占先机。",
  "Give me my pipeline brief right now: what changed since yesterday, what needs action today, what’s newly at risk. If it’s useful, set it up to run every weekday morning.": "现在就给我一份销售管线简报：自昨天以来有什么变化、今天需要处理什么、新出现哪些风险。如果有用，就设置成每个工作日早上运行。",
  "Give me my task brief right now: due today, overdue, and newly assigned to me since yesterday. If it’s useful, set it up to run every weekday morning.": "现在就给我我的任务简报：今天截止、已逾期，以及昨天起新分配给我的任务。如果有用，就设置为每个工作日早上运行。",
  "Give me my workspace digest right now — what changed, what went stale, what needs me — then offer to run it weekly.": "现在给我一份工作区摘要——什么变了、什么过期了、什么需要我——然后提议每周运行一次。",
  "Give me pointers on being a better manager": "给我一些关于做一名更好管理者的建议",
  "Give me three actions for today": "给我今天的三个行动项",
  "Give me three copy variants for a campaign — I'll paste my brief and CTA below. Try different angles (urgency, aspiration, social proof).": "给我三种活动文案变体，我会在下面贴上简报和 CTA。请尝试不同角度（紧迫感、愿景、社会认同）。",
  "Give me three copy variants for a campaign — I’ll paste my brief and CTA below. Try different angles (urgency, aspiration, social proof).": "为一个活动给我三个文案变体——我会把我的简报和 CTA 粘贴在下面。请尝试不同的角度（紧迫感、向往、社会认同）。",
  "Give me tips on how to organize my calendar": "给我一些如何整理日历的建议",
  "Give me today’s digest right now: the threads that still need me, what each is waiting for, and what can wait until tomorrow. If it’s useful, set it to arrive every day at 5pm.": "现在就给我今天的摘要：仍然需要我处理的话题、每个话题在等什么，以及哪些可以等到明天。如果有用，就把它设为每天下午 5 点送达。",
  "Give my UI the designer pass engineers skip: mock up a default unstyled settings form, then fix it step by step — spacing, hierarchy, states, empty and error cases — explaining the rule behind each change so I can reuse them on every screen I ship.": "给我的 UI 做一次工程师通常跳过的设计师检查：先做出一个默认的无样式设置表单，然后一步步修复它——间距、层级、状态、空状态和错误状态——解释每次更改背后的规则，这样我就可以在我发布的每个屏幕上复用它们。",
