  "How Claude connects to your server: URL configuration and authentication methods. These settings apply to connections exactly as entered.": "Claude 如何连接到您的服务器：URL 配置和身份验证方式。这些设置会完全按输入的方式应用于连接。",
  "How Claude identifies itself to the server’s OAuth system. A choice marked Detected came from checking the server. Keep it unless you know the server needs something else.": "Claude 如何向服务器的 OAuth 系统标识自己。标记为“已检测”的选项来自对服务器的检查。除非您知道服务器需要其他设置，否则请保持不变。",
  "How Claude structures its responses in Code sessions. Applies to new sessions; the session menu can override it for a single session.": "Claude 在 Code 会话中组织回复的方式。适用于新会话；会话菜单可为单个会话覆盖此设置。",
