  "How users who adopt each feature compare to those who don't, measured by {metric}. Suppressed when either cohort has fewer than 10 users.": "采用每项功能的用户与未采用者的对比，以 {metric} 衡量。当任一群组的用户少于 10 人时将不予显示。",
  "How users who adopt each feature compare to those who don’t, measured by {metric}. Suppressed when either cohort has fewer than 10 users.": "采用各功能的用户与未采用的用户相比如何，以 {metric} 衡量。当任一群组少于 10 名用户时不显示。",
  "How we got there": "我们如何走到这一步",
