  "Interrupts the current step so only this message is read now": "打断当前步骤，以便现在只读取这条消息",
  "Interview me about an analysis I’ve finished — question, data, method, result — then draft the write-up directly in your reply: abstract, methods, findings, limitations. Rigorous enough to defend, readable enough to share outside the team.": "就我已完成的一项分析采访我——问题、数据、方法、结果——然后直接在你的回复中起草成文：摘要、方法、发现、局限性。严谨到经得起推敲，清晰到可以分享给团队外部。",
  "Interview me about how I actually run my class — how I open, what I do when a student gives a wrong answer, how I handle the energy dip after lunch. Then tell me my teaching style straight: my signature moves, my default under pressure, and the one blind spot my students notice before I do.": "就我实际上如何开展课堂采访我——我如何开场、学生答错时我怎么做、我如何应对午后的精力低谷。然后直截了当地告诉我我的教学风格：我的标志性做法、我在压力下的默认反应，以及我的学生比我先注意到的那个盲点。",
  "Interview me about last month’s spending from memory — no statements needed, round numbers are fine. Then show me the pattern I’m not seeing, what it quietly compounds to over a year, and the two changes that would matter most. Honest, not preachy.": "采访我关于上个月支出的记忆——不需要对账单，整数即可。然后告诉我我没看出的模式、它在一年内会悄悄累积成什么，以及最关键的两个改变。坦诚，但不要说教。",
  "Interview me about my last three projects — what they were, what went well, what dragged. Then tell me what’s hard to see from inside: the skill I lean on too hard, the work I quietly avoid, and the one capability that would most change my next engagement.": "采访我关于最近三个项目的情况——它们是什么、哪些进展顺利、哪些拖沓。然后告诉我从内部很难看清的东西：我过于依赖的技能、我悄悄回避的工作，以及最能改变我下一次机会的那一项能力。",
  "Interview me about something I want to write, one question at a time — then turn my answers into a structured first draft in my own words, with notes on where it needs more from me.": "就我想写的内容采访我，一次问一个问题——然后把我的回答变成用我自己语言组织的结构化初稿，并注明哪些地方还需要我补充。",
  "Interview me about the studies I’ve done and the ones I’m dreaming about — a few questions, one at a time. Then show me the through-line: the question I keep circling back to, what’s distinctive about my angle, and the next study that would build on it.": "就我做过的和正在设想的研究采访我——几个问题，一次一个。然后向我展示那条主线：我不断绕回的问题、我的角度的独特之处，以及能在此基础上推进的下一项研究。",
  "Interview me, then draft my piece": "先采访我，再草拟我的文章",
