  "Let Claude guide you step by step?": "让 Claude 逐步引导您？",
  "Let Claude handle formulas, formatting, and data cleanup right inside your spreadsheets.": "让 Claude 直接在您的电子表格中处理公式、格式和数据清理。",
  "Let Claude handle formulas, formatting, and data cleanup.": "让 Claude 处理公式、格式化和数据清洗。",
  "Let Claude handle it": "由 Claude 处理",
  "Let Claude navigate, click, and fill forms in Chrome. Requires the Claude desktop app and the Claude in Chrome extension on this computer.": "让 Claude 在 Chrome 中导航、点击和填写表单。需要此电脑上安装 Claude 桌面应用和 Claude in Chrome 扩展。",
  "Let Claude navigate, click, and fill forms in your Chrome browser.": "让 Claude 在您的 Chrome 浏览器中导航、点击和填写表单。",
  "Let Claude power through tasks so you can focus on what matters most": "让 Claude 助您完成任务，以便您可以专注于最重要的事",
  "Let Claude read and write to the tools you already use.": "允许 Claude 在您已使用的工具中执行读取和写入操作。",
  "Let Claude remember context across chats for your org members. When off, each conversation starts fresh.": "让 Claude 为您的组织成员跨聊天记住上下文。关闭后，每次对话都会从头开始。",
  "Let Claude remember details like these": "让 Claude 记住此类细节",
