  "Make API calls on behalf of your organization": "代表您的组织进行 API 调用",
  "Make a campaign performance dashboard": "制作营销活动效果仪表板",
  "Make a competitor battlecard": "制作竞争对手作战卡",
  "Make a competitor battlecard — I’ll name the competitor, or pick a well-known rivalry in my industry as the demo. One compact table: their pitch, where they win, where we win, and two questions that set traps for them. One page, no more.": "制作一份竞争对手对战卡——我会指定竞争对手，或者以我所在行业中一个知名的竞争关系为例。一张紧凑的表格：他们的卖点、他们的优势、我们的优势，以及两个能给他们设陷阱的问题。一页纸，到此为止。",
  "Make a customer feedback digest": "制作客户反馈摘要",
  "Make a deck from my analysis": "根据我的分析制作幻灯片",
