  "Memory is on. I’ll carry what you share into every conversation — your work, how you communicate, what you care about. You can see or edit what I keep anytime in Settings.": "记忆已开启。我会把您分享的一切带入每次对话——您的工作、您的沟通方式、您关心的事情。您可以随时在设置中查看或编辑我记住的内容。",
  "Memory is private to you": "记忆仅您本人可见",
  "Memory is turned off by your organization, so educator settings aren’t available.": "记忆功能已被您的组织关闭，因此教育工作者设置不可用。",
  "Memory is turned off for your organization, so your classroom profile isn’t saved to memory.": "您的组织已关闭记忆功能，因此您的课堂配置文件不会保存到记忆中。",
  "Memory is turned off, so your classroom profile isn’t saved to memory.": "记忆功能已关闭，因此您的课堂配置文件不会保存到记忆中。",
  "Memory keeps track of": "记忆会记录",
  "Memory not applied correctly": "记忆未正常应用",
  "Memory now works the same way across chat and Cowork in the cloud (web and mobile), updating context automatically as users work. Memory is on at the org level and off for end users by default — your existing settings won’t change. Existing memories carry over. Not included for orgs with custom data retention, CMEK, HIPAA, or public-sector agreements.": "记忆功能现在在云端（网页和移动端）的对话和 Cowork 中以相同方式工作，并随着用户的工作自动更新上下文。记忆在组织层级默认开启，对最终用户默认关闭——您现有的设置不会改变。现有记忆会保留。不适用于签订自定义数据保留、CMEK、HIPAA 或公共部门协议的组织。",
