  "Once enabled, members will no longer be able to migrate personal Claude account data into this organization. If anyone still needs to bring their data over, have them <link>migrate first</link>.": "启用后，成员将无法再将个人 Claude 账户数据迁移到此组织。如果有人仍需要迁移数据，请让他们先 <link>完成迁移</link>。",
  "Once instances are heartbeating, associate environments or runner pools to route their sessions through this proxy.": "实例开始发送心跳后，关联环境或运行器池，将其会话通过此代理路由。",
