  "Per seat / month if billed annually. {standardMonthlyPrice}/seat{taxSuffix} and {premiumMonthlyPrice}/seat{taxSuffix} if billed monthly. Minimum {minimumSeatCount, plural, one {# seat} other {# seats}}.": "按年计费时每席位/月。按月计费时为 {standardMonthlyPrice}/席位{taxSuffix} 和 {premiumMonthlyPrice}/席位{taxSuffix}。最少 {minimumSeatCount, plural, one {# 个席位} other {# 个席位}}。",
  "Per seat / month if billed annually. {standardMonthlyPrice}/seat{taxSuffix} if billed monthly. Minimum {minimumSeatCount, plural, one {# seat} other {# seats}}.": "按年计费时每席位 / 月。按月计费时为 {standardMonthlyPrice}/席位{taxSuffix}。最少 {minimumSeatCount, plural, one {# 个席位} other {# 个席位}}。",
  "Per seat / month. Minimum {minimumSeatCount, plural, one {# seat} other {# seats}}.": "每席位 / 每月。最少 {minimumSeatCount, plural, one {# 个席位} other {# 个席位}}。",
  "Per {tierLabel} user": "每位 {tierLabel} 用户",
  "Per-call timeout for MCP tool calls, in seconds. Default 180 (3 minutes).": "MCP 工具调用的单次调用超时时间，以秒为单位。默认为 180（3 分钟）。",
  "Per-category amounts aren’t available yet. This preview shows the categories only.": "各类别金额暂不可用。此预览仅显示类别。",
  "Per-day spend limit. Individual limits take precedence, otherwise the group limit applies.": "每日消费限额。个人限额优先，否则适用群组限额。",
  "Per-experience limits": "各体验的限额",
  "Per-model rates replacing Anthropic list price in the Usage page’s estimate.": "按模型费率，用于替换用量页面估算中的 Anthropic 目录价格。",
  "Per-month spend limit. Individual limits take precedence, otherwise the group or seat-tier limit applies.": "每月消费限额。个人限额优先，否则适用群组或席位层级限额。",
  "Per-platform overrides": "各平台覆盖设置",
  "Per-session usage breakdowns are coming soon.": "按会话的用量明细即将推出。",
  "Per-task plugin copies": "每个任务的插件副本",
  "Per-tier spend limits become available after your trial converts to a paid plan.": "按层级的支出限制将在试用转为付费套餐后可用。",
  "Per-tool approval locks for this server.": "此服务器的逐工具批准锁定。",
  "Per-tool approval policy for built-in tools. “ask” requires user approval before each call; “allow” is the default.": "内置工具的逐工具批准策略。“ask”要求每次调用前获得用户批准；“allow”是默认值。",
  "Per-tool approval policy. \"ask\" requires user approval before each call; \"allow\" is the default. Use Disabled built-in tools to remove a tool entirely.": "按工具的批准策略。“ask”要求在每次调用前获得用户批准；“allow”是默认值。使用“禁用内置工具”可彻底移除某个工具。",
  "Per-user attribution on risky commands requires recent Claude Code client telemetry; older clients show aggregate counts only.": "高风险命令的按用户归因需要较新的 Claude Code 客户端遥测；较旧的客户端仅显示汇总计数。",
  "Per-user soft cap, counted client-side over the duration below. Not a server-enforced quota.": "每个用户的软上限，在客户端按下方时长统计。并非服务器强制执行的配额。",
  "Per-user soft cap, counted client-side over the token cap window. Not a server-enforced quota.": "每用户软上限，由客户端在 token 上限窗口内统计。并非服务器强制执行的配额。",
  "Per-user spend and output for your highest-cost users.": "你成本最高的用户的人均消费和产出。",
  "Per-week spend limit. Individual limits take precedence, otherwise the group limit applies.": "每周消费限额。个人限额优先，否则适用群组限额。",
  "Percentage of seats actively used, calculated by dividing Weekly Active Users by total seats.": "活跃使用的席位百分比，计算方式为：周活跃用户数除以总席位数。",
  "Percentage of users who created at least one artifact on {date} (UTC). Change is compared to the previous day.": "在 {date} (UTC) 创建了至少一个构件的用户百分比。该变化是与前一天对比的结果。",
  "Percentage of users who created at least one artifact on {date} (UTC). Change is compared to the same day last week.": "在 {date}（UTC）创建至少一个工件的用户百分比。变化与上周同一天相比。",
  "Percentage of users who created at least one project on {date} (UTC). Change is compared to the previous day.": "在 {date} (UTC) 创建至少一个项目的用户百分比。变化与前一天相比。",
  "Percentage of users who created at least one project on {date} (UTC). Change is compared to the same day last week.": "在 {date}（UTC）创建至少一个项目的用户百分比。变化与上周同一天相比。",
  "Percentage of users who started at least one chat on {date} (UTC). Change is compared to the previous day.": "在 {date} (UTC) 启动了至少一次聊天的用户百分比。变动量是与前一天相比。",
  "Percentage of users who started at least one chat on {date} (UTC). Change is compared to the same day last week.": "在 {date}（UTC）开始至少一次聊天的用户百分比。变化与上周同一天相比。",
  "Percentage of users who started at least one session on {date} (UTC). Change is compared to the same day last week.": "在 {date} (UTC) 启动过至少一次会话的用户百分比。变化值是与上周同一天相比。",
  "Perfect for quick tasks like organizing folders or creating short reports.": "非常适合处理诸如整理文件夹或创建简短报告之类的快速任务。",
  "Perfect for short coding sprints in small codebases.": "非常适合在小型代码库中进行短期编程冲刺。",
