  "Pre-approve actions that Claude can take on websites before you start working. You can review Claude's approach upfront, then let it run. Claude will still ask before taking certain irreversible or potentially harmful actions, like making a purchase. For trusted workflows, you can choose to skip all permissions, but you should supervise Claude closely. While some safeguards exist for sensitive actions, malicious actors could still trick Claude into unintended actions.": "在开始工作前预先批准 Claude 可在网站上采取的操作。您可以提前审阅 Claude 的方案，然后让它运行。在采取某些不可逆或潜在有害的操作（如进行购买）前，Claude 仍会询问。对于受信任的工作流，您可以选择跳过所有权限，但应密切监督 Claude。虽然针对敏感操作存在一些防护措施，但恶意行为者仍可能诱骗 Claude 采取非预期操作。",
  "Pre-approve actions that Claude can take on websites before you start working. You can review Claude’s approach upfront, then let it run. Claude will still ask before taking certain irreversible or potentially harmful actions, like making a purchase. For trusted workflows, you can choose to skip all permissions, but you should supervise Claude closely. While some safeguards exist for sensitive actions, malicious actors could still trick Claude into unintended actions.": "在您开始工作之前，预先批准 Claude 可以在网站上执行的操作。您可以事先审阅 Claude 的方案，然后让它运行。对于某些不可逆或可能有潜在危害的操作（例如购买），Claude 仍然会先询问您。对于可信的工作流，您可以选择跳过所有权限，但您应该密切监督 Claude。虽然对敏感操作存在一些保护措施，但恶意行为者仍可能诱骗 Claude 执行意外的操作。",
