  "Run - {time}": "运行 - {time}",
  "Run /remote-control in Claude Code on your computer to try again.": "在您计算机上的 Claude Code 中运行 /remote-control 以重试。",
  "Run /remote-control in Claude Code on {host} to try again.": "在 {host} 上的 Claude Code 中运行 /remote-control 以重试。",
  "Run <cmd>sudo apt install ~/Downloads/{filename}</cmd>. This also registers the Claude apt repository, so updates install with the rest of your software.": "运行 <cmd>sudo apt install ~/Downloads/{filename}</cmd>。这也会注册 Claude 的 apt 仓库，因此更新会随您其他软件一起安装。",
  "Run <code>claude rc</code> on your machine to code from here.": "在您的机器上运行 <code>claude rc</code> 即可从这里开始编码。",
  "Run <code>curl -fsSL https://claude.ai/install.sh | bash</code> in your terminal. That's it.": "在您的终端中运行 <code>curl -fsSL https://claude.ai/install.sh | bash</code> 即可。",
  "Run <code>curl -fsSL https://claude.ai/install.sh | bash</code> in your terminal. That’s it.": "在终端中运行 <code>curl -fsSL https://claude.ai/install.sh | bash</code>。就这么简单。",
  "Run <code>gh auth login</code> to authenticate.": "运行 <code>gh auth login</code> 以进行身份验证。",
  "Run Claude Code directly from the command line. Works in any shell.": "直接从命令行运行 Claude Code。适用于任何 Shell。",
  "Run Claude and your code in the cloud. No worktrees or local cloning.": "在云端运行 Claude 和您的代码。无需工作区或本地克隆。",
  "Run Claude on a schedule. Set up recurring sessions that execute your prompts automatically.": "按计划运行 Claude。设置定期会话，自动执行您的提示词。",
  "Run Claude on your organization’s infrastructure. Each environment has a set of runners that host cloud sessions.": "在您组织的基础设施上运行 Claude。每个环境都有一组托管云会话的运行器。",
  "Run Cowork and Code on your own machine": "在您自己的机器上运行 Cowork 和 Code",
  "Run a case interview with me — pick a realistic business case, play the interviewer, push on my structure and my math, then score me and show what a top-tier answer would have looked like.": "和我进行一次案例面试——选一个真实的商业案例，扮演面试官，对我的结构和数学计算提出挑战，然后给我打分并展示一个顶级回答应该是什么样的。",
  "Run a compensation benchmark for a role I name — default to a senior software engineer in the US if I don’t pick one. Research several current salary sources and note where they disagree and why, build the base, bonus, and equity picture by region and company stage, then end with a recommendation: the range to offer, what it trades off, and how to defend it to both a candidate and a CFO.": "为我指定的一个岗位做一次薪酬基准调研——如果我没指定，就默认用美国的资深软件工程师。研究多个当前的薪资来源，指出它们在哪里有分歧以及原因，按地区和公司阶段描绘出基本工资、奖金和股权的全貌，最后给出建议：应给出的薪资范围、它的取舍，以及如何向候选人和 CFO 双方解释。",
  "Run a consistency check": "运行一致性检查",
  "Run a customer 360": "运行客户 360",
  "Run a data-health check on my most active table right now — blanks, duplicates, format drift — and score it. Then offer to repeat the check every week.": "现在就对我最活跃的表格做一次数据健康检查——空值、重复项、格式漂移——并打分。然后提议每周重复一次检查。",
  "Run a due diligence review": "运行尽职调查审查",
  "Run a legal checkup on my business": "为我的业务做一次法律体检",
  "Run a legal checkup on my business: ask me five quick questions — structure, contracts, employees, IP, data — then rank where I’m most exposed and name the one document I should fix first.": "为我的业务做一次法律体检：问我五个快速问题——架构、合同、员工、知识产权、数据——然后按我的风险暴露程度排序，并指出我应该先修复的那一份文件。",
  "Run a mock discovery call": "进行一次模拟发现式通话",
  "Run a mock discovery call with me — you play a realistic, mildly skeptical prospect for a product I describe, push back like a real buyer would, then break down what I did well and what to change.": "和我进行一次模拟发现电话——你扮演一位真实、略带怀疑的潜在客户，针对我描述的产品，像真正的买家那样提出异议，然后分析我哪些做得好、哪些需要改进。",
  "Run a premortem on a project I describe in one line — or demo on ‘a six-month platform migration’. Assume it failed: the ten most likely causes ranked by probability times damage, and what to change this week. Questions after, not before.": "对我用一句话描述的项目进行预先复盘——或以“一次为期六个月的平台迁移”作为示例。假设它失败了：按概率乘以影响排列出十个最可能的原因，以及本周应该改变什么。问题放在后面，而不是前面。",
  "Run a premortem on my project": "对我的项目做一次事前剖析",
  "Run a proxy fleet in your VPC so sessions can reach internal services with credentials that never leave your network.": "在你的 VPC 中运行代理集群，使会话能够使用绝不离开你网络的凭据访问内部服务。",
  "Run a quick setup to start using the {name} plugin.": "运行快速设置以开始使用 {name} 插件。",
  "Run a scan on skills and plugins when they’re uploaded to catch possible security concerns. Any that don’t pass the scan are blocked from use.": "在技能和插件上传时对其运行扫描，以发现潜在的安全问题。任何未通过扫描的都将被阻止使用。",
  "Run a scan to see findings.": "运行扫描以查看结果。",
  "Run a security scan": "运行安全扫描",
  "Run a server to preview your app, or enter a URL.": "运行服务器以预览您的应用，或输入 URL。",
  "Run a three-way match on my invoices, purchase orders, and delivery records — I’ll describe or paste what I have — and produce a discrepancy table ranked by dollar impact, with matched and unmatched items clearly flagged. Nothing handy yet? Demo on a small fictional set right in this chat.": "对我的发票、采购订单和交付记录做三方匹配——我会描述或粘贴我手头的内容——并生成一张按金额影响排序的差异表，清楚标出匹配和未匹配的项目。手头还没有？就在此聊天中用一组小的虚构数据演示一下。",
  "Run a variance analysis": "运行差异分析",
  "Run a vendor selection for a tool I name — default to help-desk software if I don’t pick one. Ask me two quick questions about team size and must-haves, research the market and shortlist five vendors, dig into each one’s pricing, integrations, and what real users complain about, then score them against my answers and give me a recommendation with the runner-up, the dealbreakers you found, and the questions to ask in demos.": "为我指定的一款工具进行供应商筛选——如果我没有指定，就默认选帮助台软件。问我两个关于团队规模和必备功能的快速问题，调研市场并列出五家候选供应商，深入研究每家的定价、集成情况以及真实用户的抱怨，然后根据我的回答给它们打分，给我一个推荐，并附上第二选择、你发现的致命问题以及在演示中要问的问题。",
