  "Run me a variance analysis — actuals vs budget, the biggest deltas explained, and flag anything that doesn't reconcile. Pull the data from my connected tools. If you're missing a source, ask before building.": "帮我做一份差异分析——实际值与预算对比，解释最大的差异，并标记任何无法对账的项目。从我已连接的工具中获取数据。如果缺少某个来源，请在动手之前询问。",
