  "Sent": "已发送",
  "Sent alongside the IAP token on every proxied request — for backends behind IAP with their own API key. Cannot target a header the IAP handler already uses: the IAP token’s header, or Authorization when App audience is set. Values are write-only and never shown after saving.": "在每个代理请求中与 IAP 令牌一同发送——适用于位于 IAP 之后、拥有自己 API 密钥的后端。不能指向 IAP 处理器已使用的标头：IAP 令牌的标头，或设置了 App audience 时的 Authorization。值为只写，保存后不会显示。",
  "Sent alongside the IAP token on every proxied request, for backends behind IAP with their own API key. Cannot target a header the IAP handler already uses: the IAP token’s header, or Authorization when App audience is set. Values are write-only and never shown after saving.": "在每个经代理的请求中随 IAP 令牌一同发送，适用于位于 IAP 之后且拥有自己 API 密钥的后端。不能以 IAP 处理程序已使用的标头为目标：IAP 令牌的标头，或设置了 App audience 时的 Authorization。值为只写，保存后不再显示。",
  "Sent alongside the access token on every request Claude sends to the allowed websites, for APIs that need an extra key. Values are write-only and never shown after saving.": "在 Claude 向允许的网站发送的每个请求中随访问令牌一起发送，适用于需要额外密钥的 API。值为只写，保存后永不显示。",
  "Sent an attachment": "已发送附件",
